      "date": "2026-11-06 01:03:52.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n### NOTE: This patch has been classified as trivial due to the minimal changes\n\n#### The following sessions will be run for Build 135527 (patch #1):\n\n#### Enforced:\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne on el8.10-x86_64/el8.10-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n- review-dne-subtest-change on el8.10-x86_64/el8.10-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n- review-dne-zfs-subtest-change on el8.10-x86_64/el8.10-x86_64/zfs/zfs\n\n- rolling-downgrade-mds on el8.10-x86_64/el8.10-x86_64/zfs/zfs\n\n- rolling-downgrade-client1 on el8.10-x86_64/el8.10-x86_64/zfs/zfs\n\n#### The following sessions were skipped because they are untestable:\n\n#### Untestable Optional:\n\n- Test Config #23: review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on el8.10-x86_64/rocky9.5-aarch64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n  - client: rocky9.5 - aarch64 | lustre-reviews #135527\n\n#### Supported build configurations for lustre-reviews #135527:\n\n#### Clients\n\n  - el8.10     - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - el8.9      - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - el9.4      - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - el9.5      - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - el9.6      - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - el9.7      - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - sles15sp4  - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - sles15sp5  - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - sles15sp6  - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - ubuntu2004 - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - ubuntu2204 - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n#### Servers\n\n  - el8.10 - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n  - el8.9  - x86_64 - inkernel\n\n---\n\nMaloo Test Queue: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_queue?jobs=lustre-reviews&builds=135527&commit=Apply+Filter\n\nMaloo Results: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/related?jobs=lustre-reviews&builds=135527#redirect",
