        "subject": "LU-17047 tests: sanity/77c ensure ost debug_path is valid",
        "message": "LU-17047 tests: sanity/77c ensure ost debug_path is valid\n\ntest_77c has been failing intermittently for a while due\nto either debug_param not being set properly before this test is\ninvoked or due to silent failure of getting the param from the\nremote node.\n\nTry to avoid these spurious test flakiness by forcing the\ndebug_path parameter to the expected setting during test startup.\nA test shouldn't depend on no residuals being present from\nunrelated prior tests anyway.\n\nThe rolling-downgrade sessions run the b2_15 sanity.sh against\nmaster servers, so the fix that landed on master never reaches\nthem and 77c fails there on nearly every run.\n\nLustre-change: https://review.whamcloud.com/56643\nLustre-commit: 0bb0b2938c41c4181d7f536675700606932699f6\nTest-Parameters: testgroup=rolling-downgrade-mds\nTest-Parameters: testgroup=rolling-downgrade-client1\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I9f66b6b5fccf244416566942fb2bcd9752d4f054\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/b2_15"
    }
